  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845868,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 007 - From Russia with Love (PSP)\n\nStep into the world of espionage and adventure with *007 - From Russia with Love* for the Sony PlayStation Portable! This thrilling action-adventure game faithfully recreates the iconic 1963 film and the classic 60s Bond era.  Assume the role of the legendary James Bond as he navigates a perilous mission to Istanbul, tasked with protecting the beautiful Soviet agent, Tatiana Romanova, and securing a vital microfilm.\n\nExperience a blend of faithful movie-based missions and original, adrenaline-fueled action sequences. Engage in a diverse range of gameplay, from intense hand-to-hand combat and stealthy infiltration to high-octane vehicle chases.  Utilize classic Bond weaponry and gadgetry, now enhanced with modern mechanics, and upgrade them to suit your style.  Enjoy social multiplayer experiences and be captivated by the allure of gorgeous women, all while unraveling a conspiracy that threatens global security.  *007 - From Russia with Love* delivers a truly immersive Bond experience, perfectly suited for on-the-go gaming."
    },
